    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d837">

                <pb facs="0779" n="607" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg607"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.6232/8</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stimson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-01T11:00:00-04:16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 1, 1917, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 1.10 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My May 12, 11 a.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d837-f1"/> The British Minister informs
                    me under instructions from his Government he has granted a safe-conduct to
                        Pauli<anchor n="2" xml:id="d837-f2"/> to proceed to
                    Germany via the United States on Dutch vessel <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Frisia</hi> sailing from here June 4. If he asks for safe-conduct to New
                    York, shall I give it?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d837-f1" n="1" xml:id="d837-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d837-f2" n="2" xml:id="d837-f2-content">
                <p>He had, meanwhile, proceeded by train from Rio de Janeiro to Buenos Aires.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
